# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` — copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill.
# In staging/prod these are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME> --env <env>`.

# Audit + session sink (POST /v1/events → EU D1):
# APP_API_TOKEN=""   # the bearer token the mobile/hybrid apps send (Authorization: Bearer …)
# IP_HASH_SALT=""    # salt for hashing IPs before storage (never a raw IP is stored)

# Announcements (GET /v1/announcements → Sanity). PROJECT_ID/DATASET go in wrangler.toml
# [vars] (public); the read token is a secret, needed only if the dataset is not public-read:
# SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=""   # server-side Sanity read token (never shipped to clients)
